// [2] Root avoidance: Engine runs as root (sudo for raw sockets), VulpineOS must run as non-root
// [3] CDP: WebSocket on localhost:{port} for Runtime.evaluate JS injection
// [4] UFW/iptables: No firewall rules needed — VulpineOS makes outbound HTTPS only
// [5] Port isolation: Tüm kaynaklar (profil, script, log) port bazlı türetilir → paralel run destegi

